WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:06.254
The formula, before you walk in: what you want, divided by what you've got,

2
00:00:06.254 --> 00:00:07.352
times the volume.

3
00:00:07.352 --> 00:00:09.613
And convert to the same unit first.

4
00:00:09.613 --> 00:00:12.261
These are her own formative calculations.

5
00:00:12.261 --> 00:00:13.101
Try each one.

6
00:00:13.551 --> 00:00:16.742
<v Examiner>Cilazapril five hundred milligrams is prescribed.

7
00:00:16.742 --> 00:00:19.868
<v Examiner>You have tablets of nought point two five grams.

8
00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:20.975
<v Examiner>How many tablets?

9
00:00:21.425 --> 00:00:26.517
Convert first: nought point two five grams is two hundred and fifty milligrams.

10
00:00:26.517 --> 00:00:30.449
Five hundred divided by two hundred and fifty is two tablets.

11
00:00:30.899 --> 00:00:34.372
<v Examiner>Adrenaline nought point three milligrams I M stat.

12
00:00:34.372 --> 00:00:38.470
<v Examiner>The ampoule is one in a thousand, one milligram in one mil.

13
00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:39.304
<v Examiner>What volume?

14
00:00:39.754 --> 00:00:44.127
Nought point three divided by one, times one mil: nought point three mils.

15
00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:49.933
<v Examiner>A baby weighs eleven kilograms and is prescribed penicillin twenty milligrams per

16
00:00:49.933 --> 00:00:50.528
<v Examiner>kilogram.

17
00:00:50.528 --> 00:00:51.916
<v Examiner>What's a single dose?

18
00:00:52.366 --> 00:00:55.630
Twenty times eleven: two hundred and twenty milligrams.

19
00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:01.652
<v Examiner>Cherry weighs eleven kilograms and is prescribed carbamazepine four milligrams per

20
00:01:01.652 --> 00:01:02.264
<v Examiner>kilogram.

21
00:01:02.264 --> 00:01:05.390
<v Examiner>It comes as a hundred milligrams in five mils.

22
00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:06.341
<v Examiner>How many mils?

23
00:01:06.791 --> 00:01:09.775
Four times eleven is forty-four milligrams.

24
00:01:09.775 --> 00:01:14.770
Forty-four divided by a hundred, times five mils, is two point two mils.

25
00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:19.148
Two traps from her overview deck: never write a trailing zero,

26
00:01:19.148 --> 00:01:22.822
because one point nought milligrams can be misread as ten.

27
00:01:22.822 --> 00:01:27.700
And always write a leading zero: nought point two five, never point two five.

28
00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:33.596
Calculations: what you want over what you've got, times the volume; convert units first.

29
00:01:33.596 --> 00:01:38.360
Five hundred milligrams from nought point two five gram tablets: two tablets.

30
00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:42.568
Adrenaline nought point three milligrams from one milligram per mil:

31
00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:44.053
nought point three mils.

32
00:01:44.053 --> 00:01:46.838
Weight-based: dose per kilogram times weight.
